Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=('e3f5e48f02686da13af5c6ba474a7935d9ee239813d30f171fb6876c858df2f9',), event=Revised(decision='gateworkspace', at=datetime(2026, 11, 28, 5, 51, 45, 562216), actor='assistant', title='The pre-merge gate covers the whole workspace with all targets and the fixture feature, in the triage shell', body='Run clippy over the whole workspace, all targets, with the fixture feature and warnings denied, inside `nix develop .#triage`. Also run the live and guards tests, which a plain workspace test run skips. Run a per-crate gate only for a pure leaf change. Never export a variable that the gate itself keys on.', rationale="A change to a public sum or struct breaks crates the change never opened, and a gate that lists crates tells nothing about the others. The triage shell pins the toolchain that the gate uses. A clippy from another environment is another version: in pull request 677, a cloud container's newer clippy flagged code that the change did not touch.", supersedes=()))